Test-only fixed 1/60 s game step (GOW_PAD_TEST=1 + GOW_TEST_FIXED_STEP=1; default off, never a player mode).
The game scales each frame by elapsed fields, so frame-indexed scripted runs diverged on slow machines (88 units by
frame 240 at ~26 FPS with identical frame 0). Movies, game fixed/one-shot steps and the experimental rate keep their path.
Validation: tools/test/logic-rate.cpp.in; gs-run-ab.py --fixed-step; docs/research/fixed-step-2026-11-12.md.

